17
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:43,820
For the folks that don't know what Go-Go is,

18
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:48,820
can you give them some kind of like description of what the style of Go-Go music is that represents D.C.?

19
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:56,540
Go-Go music, when you think of different places, you know, New Orleans and Go-Go, these are musicians.

20
00:00:56,540 --> 00:01:02,040
These are people who play instruments, you know, and the percussion is where it's at.

21
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:09,040
