22
00:01:09,180 --> 00:01:13,500
It's just a feel-good music where the talent shines through.

23
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:18,600
They can take any song, turn it around, turn it into a Go-Go song, and we'll have you two-step in.

24
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:21,940
And people who are not from D.C. will always say, what is that?

25
00:01:22,020 --> 00:01:22,260
Is that?

26
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:23,000
That's Go-Go.

27
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:26,580
And it's just one of those types of music that you feel in your soul.

